    "body": "This PR adds a test case that checks that a switch to tx relay via `filterclear` can trigger eviction. \r\n\r\nIt kills the following mutant (https://mutanthub.space/mutants/3746):\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/src/net_processing.cpp b/src/net_processing.cpp\r\nindex 96caf9050f..d9019db877 100644\r\n--- a/src/net_processing.cpp\r\n+++ b/src/net_processing.cpp\r\n@@ -5312,7 +5312,6 @@ void PeerManagerImpl::ProcessMessage(Peer& peer, CNode& pfrom, const std::string\r\n         }\r\n         pfrom.m_bloom_filter_loaded = false;\r\n         pfrom.m_relays_txs = true;\r\n-        MaybeDisconnectForTxRelayCapacity(pfrom, msg_type);\r\n         return;\r\n     }\r\n\r\n```",
